  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\MultiSettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Choose your settings, then select <b>Accept</b> to save them. Check the <b>Learn more</b> link for info on these settings, how to change them, how Windows helps protect you from unsafe apps and web content, and the related data transfers and uses.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LocationVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Now, choose if you want to let Microsoft and other apps use your location to help you with directions, weather, and more.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bu parametrlar haqida batafsil
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Batafsil
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\InputDiagnosticsVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: And if you want to help improve language recognition and suggestions for apps and services that run on Windows, you can choose to do that here.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\FindMyDeviceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: And if you ever lose your device, here's where you get to choose if you want help finding it.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Davom etish
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\AdsVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Last up for these settings, choose whether or not you want your ads to be more relevant to you.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\Title:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Required data collection
  \oobeSettingsAadc\Subtitle:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Your privacy is important, which is why we want you to understand the data we collect.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubText2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Microsoft strives to provide the best possible protection from digital threats. To help achieve this, Microsoft Defender SmartScreen and Smart App Control collect info about websites you visit, files you download, and apps you install and run. This data is used to warn you and help protect you, your device, and your passwords from unsafe apps and web content.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubText1:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Microsoft collects info about your device, its settings and capabilities, and whether it’s performing properly. Required diagnostic data is the minimum level of diagnostic data needed to help keep your device reliable, secure, operating normally, and to make related improvements to Windows.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubHeader2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Protection from unsafe apps and web content
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubHeader1:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Required diagnostic data
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcTitle:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Required data collection
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcNextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Next
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcLearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Learn More
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcBodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Microsoft collects required data to keep your device up to date, secure, and working properly. This might include info about your files, app settings, and info used to help fix problems.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Next
  \oobeSettingsAadc\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: It looks like we are having some connectivity issues - you may not be connected to the internet, or there is an issue on our end. You can read more about Required diagnostic data by typing https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2162067 into the address bar of any browser on any device.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Learn more about required data collection
  \oobeSettingsAadc\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Learn more
  \oobeSettingsAadc\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Continue
