  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreNavigationError:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: It looks like we are having some connectivity issues - you may not be connected to the internet, or there is an issue on our end. You can read the full Microsoft Privacy Statement anytime by typing aka.ms/privacy into the address bar of any browser on any device.
  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreLinkText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Learn more about account protection
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Qurilmangizda Windows Hello bilan ishlaydigan barmoq izi skaneri bor, u sizni oddiy, paroldan xoli usulda identifikatsiya qila oladi.
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFace:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Kamerangiz Windows Hello yordamida sizni taniy oladi hamda sizni oddiy, paroldan xoli usulda identifikatsiya qila oladi.
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC with just your fingerprint. It's not only faster, it's more secure than a password. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintIconAriaLabel:
