  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\Title:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Is this account for a child or teenager?
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\Subtitle:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: If so, consider signing in with a Microsoft account. When younger family members log in with a Microsoft account, they’ll have privacy protections focused on their age. Parents and guardians can also set up a family group with Microsoft Family Safety.
