  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\OobeAadcAgeConfirmationBodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Is this account for a child or teenager?<br><br>When younger family members log in with a Microsoft account, they’ll have privacy protections focused on their age. Parents and guardians can also set up a family group with Microsoft Family Safety. Setting up a family group helps everyone stay safe online and in real life with screen time limits, content filters, location sharing, and more.
