    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Diagnostika axboroti olinmoqda...
  \hololensDiagnostics\PrivacyStatementLink:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Maxfiylik bayonnomasi
  \hololensDiagnostics\PrivacyHeadline:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Maxfiylik bayonnomasi
  \hololensDiagnostics\PrivacyBody:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: To‘planadigan ma’lumotlar haqida batafsil axborot olish uchun istalgan qurilmada brauzer orqali https://aka.ms/privacy sahifasini oching.
  \hololensDiagnostics\NextButton:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Axborot to‘plash
  \hololensDiagnostics\Instruction4:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: 4. Fayllar saqlab olingach, shu yerga qaytib keling va Tayyor tugmasini bosing. Shundan keyin fayllar HoloLens qurilmangizdan olib tashlanadi.
  \hololensDiagnostics\Instruction3:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: 3. HoloLens diagnostika fayllarini kompyuteringizga nusxalang.
  \hololensDiagnostics\Instruction2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: 2. Fayl eksplorerni ochish uchun kompyuteringizda so‘rovlarni qabul qiling.
  \hololensDiagnostics\Instruction1:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: 1. HoloLens qurilmangizni kompyuteringizga ulang.
  \hololensDiagnostics\Instruction0:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Diagnostika axborotini kompyuteringizga saqlash uchun:
  \hololensDiagnostics\ContinueButton:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bajarildi
  \hololensDiagnostics\CancelButton:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bekor qilish
  \hololensDiagnostics\BodyTroubleshooting:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Diagnostika axboroti hisobingizga kirishda yuz bergan muammoni bartaraf etishga yordam berishi mumkin. Mazkur axborot olingach, ushbu qurilmaga kira oladigan har kim undan foydalana oladi. Siz, shuningdek, uni Microsoft yoki administratoringizga yuborish uchun kompyuteringizga saqlab olishingiz ham mumkin.
  \hololensDiagnostics\BodySuccess:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Axborotni kompyuteringizga saqlagach, uni administratoringizga yuboring yoki Ko‘mak xizmatiga murojaat qilganda uni ham biriktiring.
  \hololensDiagnostics\BodyError:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Diagnostika jurnalini tayyorlash va to‘plash amalga oshmadi. Boshqa hisob bilan urinib ko‘ring.
