  \hello\LeadTextFaceFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows’ga qaysi usulda kirmoqchisiz? Windows Hello xizmatini ishga tushirish uchun <strong>Yuz</strong> yoki <strong>Barmoq izi</strong> deng.
  \hello\LeadTextFace:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows Hello xizmatini sozlash uchun <strong>Davom etish</strong> deng yoki shu tugma ustiga bosing.
