  \deviceUser\NextButton:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: &Keyingisi
  \deviceUser\LeadText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bu qurilma umumiy foydalaniladigan ish joyidami? Agar shunday bo‘lsa, har qanday foydalanuvchiga Microsoft Teams va Skype kabi ilovalarga kirish huquqini beruvchi hisobga kiring.
