  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Qisqa qilib aytganda, men Sizning shaxsiy yordamchingizman.<br/>Siz uchun har doim tayyor.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Salom, men Cortana.<br/>Men narsalarni osonlashtirish va ularni bajarishda Sizga yordam berish uchun keldim.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Cortana – bu har doim xizmatingizga tayyor bo‘lgan ishonchli yordamchingizdir. U sizni super, qahramon bo‘lishingizga yo‘l ko‘rsatib, hamma narsaga ulgurishingizga yordam beradi.<br/><br/>Cortana sizga moslashtirilgan imkoniyatlarni taqdim etishi hamda qiziqishlaringizga mos takliflarni berishi uchun Microsoft qurilmangizda joylashuvingiz haqidagi axborotlarni va joylashuv tarixini, kontaktlar, ovoz bilan matn kiritish haqidagi axborotlar, ovoz va husnixatingizning o‘ziga xos xususiyatlari, klaviatura yordamida matn kiritish qaydlari, qidiruv so‘rovlari tarixi, taqvim ma’lumotlari, o‘zaro yozishmalar va ilovalardagi kontent va muloqot tarixi va boshqa ma’lumotlarni to‘playdi va ulardan foydalanadi. Microsoft Edge brauzerida Cortana veb-sahifalarni ko‘rish tarixidan ham foydalanadi. Cortana qaydlardagi qaysi ma’lumotlarni eslab qolishini istalgan vaqt o‘zgartirish hamda Cortana xizmatini Microsoft Edge brauzerida ishlamaydigan qilib qo‘yishingiz mumkin.
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptTitle:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Parolingizni kiriting
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptCaption:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Xavfsizlik yuzasidan, tizimga kirish uchun parolingizni yana bir marta kiriting.
  \MicrosoftInternalMetadata\ContentChecksumValue:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: 2532485720
